 can't  keep your social distance you are a face  mask because one out of three people  who've got this virus won't show  symptoms it's one of the most unselfish  things that you can do  from tfl we're providing the maximum  amount of public trials that we can  tubes buses trams overground it's really  important though that we receive a  long-term deal from the government in  the absence of a long-term deal for tfl  we're going to have to reduce tube  services by almost 10  bus services by almost 20  and that will lead to  less public transport more congestion  more chances of this virus passing on  is irresponsible do you think to hold  the strike at this time  well the key thing for rmt to do is to  get back around the table with tfl to  resolve any differences that they have i  think strikes whenever they occur are a  sign of failure because i think always  disputes can be resolved amicably around  a table rather the need for strike  action
 

